direction: down
title: Java 21 Structured Concurrency: StructuredTaskScope Lifecycle

ParentScope: Parent Request Scope (StructuredTaskScope.ShutdownOnFailure) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  
  T1: Subtask 1: fetchUserData() [Virtual Thread 1] {
    style.fill: "#0F172A"
    style.stroke: "#10B981"
  }
  
  T2: Subtask 2: fetchAccountBalance() [FAILS] {
    style.fill: "#1C1917"
    style.stroke: "#EF4444"
    error: "Throws TimeoutException"
  }
  
  Cancel: Short-Circuit Cancellation {
    style.fill: "#1E1B4B"
    style.stroke: "#8B5CF6"
    action: "Scope cancels Subtask 1 via thread interrupt"
  }
  
  T2 -> Cancel: Error notifies scope { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
  Cancel -> T1: Automatically interrupts pending sibling { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
}

Guarantee: Syntactic block guarantees zero thread leaks
